================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

This project ports, bundles, or builds against the following third-party
software, under permissive licenses (MIT or Apache-2.0). NOTICE carries the
complete list, including the file-by-file mapping of the acestep.cpp ports and
the optional Python packages used by scripts/.

* ggml (MIT License), Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors.
  Consumed as a system package through the ggml-speech vcpkg port; no ggml
  sources are vendored here.
  Source: https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml

* acestep.cpp (MIT License), Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The acestep.cpp authors.
  Most of the C++ inference path under src/acestep/ is ported from this
  project's ggml implementation, parts of it verbatim.
  Source: https://github.com/ServeurpersoCom/acestep.cpp

* ACE-Step 1.5 (MIT License), model architecture and weights.
  The 5 Hz LM, FSQ detokenizer, DiT flow-matching transformer, and Oobleck VAE
  stages implement this architecture. The weights are ACE Studio's and
  StepFun's and carry the terms of their own model cards.
  Source: https://github.com/ace-step/ACE-Step-1.5

* Qwen3-Embedding (Apache License 2.0), weights for the text-encoder stage.
  Source: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B
